@page "/about"

<PageTitle>About Us</PageTitle>

<MudText Typo="Typo.h4" GutterBottom="true">About Us</MudText>
<MudText Typo="Typo.body1">
    BikeBuilder is a prototype playground for assembling custom bikes: manage a catalog of
    components, combine them into bike builds, and rate the results — with live activity
    streaming to a public site.
</MudText>
<MudText Typo="Typo.body1" Class="mt-2">
    It's an experiment in Claude-assisted development. The full source lives on
    <MudLink Href="https://github.com/nickshepherd1983/BikeBuilder" Target="_blank">GitHub</MudLink>.
</MudText>
